Behaviours:
- Change the default session lifetime from 30 days to 3650 days so newly issued direct-pairing sessions last ten years on this private, single-operator deployment.
- Preserve explicit lifetime overrides and device revocation through Settings > Connections; existing expired sessions still require pairing again.
- Guard the default 3650-day issued-session lifetime in the existing active-session listing test.

Integration details:
- Preserve upstream DPoP renewal-chain behavior and every explicit TTL; only the default changes.

